{
  "recommendation": "The strongest documented fit is the Business Gold Rewards Card, provided your business qualifies and the Apple Music charge is classified as operations spending.",
  "options": [
    {
      "card": "Business Gold Rewards Card",
      "rewards": "2.5% cash back on operations spending; 1.0% on other purchases",
      "estimated_reward_on_100000_purchase": "$2,500 if classified as operations spending; otherwise $1,000",
      "annual_fee": "$200",
      "estimated_net_reward_after_annual_fee": "$2,300 at 2.5% cash back, or $800 at 1.0%",
      "credit_limit": "$37,500 to $225,000 initially, subject to approval",
      "eligibility": "Minimum personal credit score of 735 and business PAYDEX score of 67",
      "apr": "17.99% on carried balances"
    },
    {
      "card": "Business Silver Rewards Card",
      "rewards": "The available information confirms it is a business rewards card, but does not provide enough reliable details about its purchase rewards rate, fee, or credit limit to calculate the return on this transaction.",
      "caution": "Its documented provisional-credit tier does not establish that it can support a $100,000 purchase."
    },
    {
      "card": "Business Platinum Rewards Card",
      "rewards": "The available information confirms it is a business rewards card, but does not provide enough reliable details about its purchase rewards rate, fee, or credit limit to calculate the return.",
      "caution": "I cannot confirm from the available information that it is a better choice for this purchase."
    }
  ],
  "important_considerations": [
    "A $100,000 charge would require an approved available credit limit of at least $100,000. The Business Gold card's stated range can accommodate that, but approval and the actual limit are determined by underwriting.",
    "Confirm with Apple or Rho-Bank how the merchant transaction will be coded before relying on the 2.5% operations-spend rate.",
    "Pay the statement in full if possible. Carrying $100,000 at a 17.99% APR could substantially outweigh the rewards.",
    "The Business Gold card has a $200 annual fee, which is included in the net-reward estimates above.",
    "I found no documented sign-up bonus for the Business Gold card, so I have not included one in the calculation."
  ],
  "bottom_line": "If the purchase receives the 2.5% operations-spend rate and you receive a sufficient credit limit, the Business Gold Rewards Card would produce approximately $2,500 in cash back, or about $2,300 after its annual fee."
}

